Subject: [PATCH 09/10] husky: stock TrustTokenService roots

zuma/gs201 0001 drop the trees' GoogleConfigOverlay in favour of
vendor/pixel-style's copy, which lacks the trust-token root keys stock
husky's GoogleConfigOverlay carries (vendor_required_trust_token_roots and
its timestamp). Copy them from stock into FrameworkResOverlayStockHusky.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
